sequenceDiagram
    participant SW as Settings window
    participant P as OneTextSettingsProvider
    participant H as OneTextHub
    participant S as HubShell
    participant T as HubSection (e.g. HubDoctorTab)

    SW->>P: activateHandler(searchContext, root)
    P->>H: Mount() (CreateInstance, hideFlags DontSave)
    H->>H: OnEnable: read EditorPrefs OneText.Hub.Folders and OneText.Hub.Section, BuildSections()
    P->>H: CreateUI()
    H->>S: new HubShell(hub)
    S->>S: HubUI.LoadTree("OneTextHub").CloneTree, LoadStyle("OneTextHub"), BuildNav()
    H->>S: Select(Find(pending or s_requested))
    S->>T: Build(hub) -> Compose(root)
    S->>T: OnShow()
    S->>S: RefreshNav() (BadgeText per section)
    H-->>P: shell.Root
    P->>SW: root.Add(ui) - schedule Tick() every 500 ms
    loop every 500 ms
        SW->>H: Tick()
        H->>T: Current.Tick() (only HubAtlasTab does work, and only in play mode)
    end
    SW->>P: deactivateHandler()
    P->>H: Unmount(hub) -> DestroyImmediate
    H->>H: OnDisable: write EditorPrefs section and folders, Dispose() every section
